---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Nudge demo | See how it works"
  description="Watch the Nudge demo and read a quick summary of how the AI chat widget answers questions from your business documents."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-indigo-700">Product demo</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">
        See Nudge in action
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
        Nudge turns your PDFs, help guides, and internal knowledge into a helpful website chat experience.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/60">
      <iframe
        src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/BlESyKnSQgY"
        title="Nudge demo video"
        loading="lazy"
        class="aspect-video w-full"
        allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
        allowfullscreen
      ></iframe>
    </div>

    <article class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 text-base leading-8 text-slate-700">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Transcript summary</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        The demo shows how a business can upload documents like FAQs, onboarding guides, and policy PDFs, then let Nudge answer customer questions directly on the website.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Instead of waiting for a team member to reply manually, visitors get fast, grounded answers based on the company’s own information.
        The assistant can help with account questions, product details, and common next steps while keeping the conversation consistent with the brand.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        This makes support more responsive, reduces repetitive questions, and gives customers a more helpful experience without slowing down the team.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
